      "id": "SecurityFullRegressionTests.testHugeCostsAreClampedSoDojixsOwnBackupRestores",
      "line": 123,
      "subject": "TradeRepository.updateCosts (Trade.money clamp) + Trade.storageViolations",
      "kind": "validation",
      "input": {
        "helper": "SecFixture.trade",
        "trade": {
          "ticket": 7
        },
        "updateCosts": {
          "commission": "5e15",
          "swap": "-7e20"
        }
      },
      "expect": [
        {
          "path": "stored.storageViolations",
          "op": "eq",
          "value": [],
          "line": 134,
          "derived": false
        },
        {
          "path": "stored.commission",
          "op": "eq",
          "value": "1000000000000",
          "line": 135,
          "derived": false
        },
        {
          "path": "stored.swap",
          "op": "eq",
          "value": "-1000000000000",
          "line": 136,
          "derived": false
        },
        {
          "path": "backup.validatedContents",
          "op": "notNil",
          "line": 141,
          "derived": false
        }
      ],
      "parity": "match",
      "notes": "Typed costs are clamped to +/-Trade.moneyLimit (1e12; asserted as Trade.moneyLimit / -Trade.moneyLimit, written here as Decimal strings) so the journal's own backup passes restore validation. Line 141 is XCTAssertNoThrow(validatedContents(of: backup))."
    },
